// REJECTS: Unexpected token 'scopeElements'. Valid alternatives: ['generationNodes', 'fileGenerations']
//
// The reverse direction: `scopeElements`, a FileGeneration keyword, inside a
// GenerationSpecification, whose body admits only generationNodes and fileGenerations.
//
// Unlike neg-generation-spec-in-filegeneration-section.pure this one IS caught by the
// grammar, and the asymmetry is the point -- GenerationSpecification has a closed body,
// FileGeneration has an open one, so the same category of mistake is a parse error in one
// direction and undetectable in the other.
###GenerationSpecification
GenerationSpecification fixture::neg::ScopeElementsOnSpec
{
   scopeElements: [fixture::neg::Person];
   fileGenerations: [
      fixture::neg::AvroConfig
   ];
}
